    "rowKey": "Vex Mythoclast\n\nTimeless Mythoclast\nTemporal Unlimiter\n↑Calculated Balance",
    "section": "Energy Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Primary Solar Fusion Rifle.\nBehaves like a High-Impact Auto Rifle. Counts ONLY for Fusion Rifle related interactions.\n\nFires individual Fusion Bolts at 400RPM Full-Auto from a different timeline in Auto Rifle Mode.\nFusion Bolts deal 66 [?] Damage with a 1.8x Precision Multiplier.\n\nUpon emptying the Magazine:\nRefills 80% of all damage instances scored. Always rounds up. Counter persists through stow.\nRequires scoring at least 9 hits for refill to activate. Always rounds up. \nNo cooldown preventing hits from counting, unlike Rewind Rounds.\n\nKills in Auto Rifle Mode grants Overcharge stacks, up to a maximum of 6 stacks.\nTier 1 and T2 Combatants = 1 | T3 and T4 = 2 | Guardians = 2\n\nLinear Rifle Overcharge Mode: Hold [Reload] while at 6 Overcharge stacks to swap into Overcharge Mode.\nFires Linear Fusion Shots that deal 461 [168] damage with a 3.2x Precision Multiplier.\nLinear Fusion Precision Kills trigger an ignition that deals 5% increased damage.\nEach shot fired consumes 2 Overcharge Charges, allowing up to 3 shots per activation.\nOvercharge is removed on stow. Fully refills magazine on deactivation.\n\n↑Calculated Balance:\nOn Weapon Kill or upon scoring 15 hits within 1 seconds of each:\n20% increased damage, +30 Stability, and -20% Accuracy Cone Size for 5 seconds for Auto Rifle Mode.\nDamage buff persists through stow.",
